<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12460] Cluster fails to find the node by consistent ID</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12460</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce 1:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start cluster of three nodes&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Navigate to Baseline screen&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start one more node&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Include it into baseline&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Hit &apos;Save&apos; btn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Expected:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Success alert, node enters baseline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Actual:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Exception is thrown and is displayed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce 2:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start topology with 2 nodes.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Activate cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start third node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Stop second node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Try to add third node to baseline in Web console.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Also reproduced with &lt;b&gt;control.sh --baseline set&lt;/b&gt; command.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
